lt, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top right corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/4a/4a10c8332a5f346d393c37531c13db6aa69d4cecb241efd7c34d57f32d5a98b8.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=9-2{x}_{i}-6{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(9-2{x}_{i}-6{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $9-2{x}_{i}-6{y}_{j}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393522 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393523 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393522 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393524 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393522 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393525 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393522 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393526 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393522 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393527 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393522 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393522 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393522 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186393525 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393522 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "df84a140-508e-52ee-98bd-0a46d5280afa" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393523 #edb/ref 1080 "{x}_{i}+7{y}_{j}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393523 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393523 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "67b87e94-eb0b-57a6-8d55-cb9743dbcc56" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393524 #edb/ref 1080 "9-2{x}_{i-1}-6{y}_{j-1}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393524 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393524 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2288b855-e0cb-5cd0-89ef-073ce6f0c0b0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393525 #edb/ref 1080 "9-2{x}_{i}-6{y}_{j}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592